{"id":632,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"キリスト教と五本柱で育む人間教育","feature_description":"キリスト教と五本柱で育む人間教育を教育の中心に据え、教科の学びと学校生活を結び付けながら、生徒が自ら考え行動する力を育てます。基礎となる知識や技能を着実に身に付けるとともに、探究、対話、行事、部活動などの経験を通して、多様な仲間と協働し課題に向き合います。一人ひとりが目標を見つけ、学びを深め、社会や世界に関わる視野を広げられるよう支える教育です。","clubs":[{"id":11703,"name":"陸上競技","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://jh.kwansei.ac.jp/about/club","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11704,"name":"水泳","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://jh.kwansei.ac.jp/about/club","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11705,"name":"サッカー","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://jh.kwansei.ac.jp/about/club","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11706,"name":"野球","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://jh.kwansei.ac.jp/about/club","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11707,"name":"テニス","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://jh.kwansei.ac.jp/about/club","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11708,"name":"剣道","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://jh.kwansei.ac.jp/about/club","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11709,"name":"タッチフットボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://jh.kwansei.ac.jp/about/club","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11710,"name":"バスケットボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://jh.kwansei.ac.jp/about/club","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11711,"name":"バレーボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://jh.kwansei.ac.jp/about/club","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11712,"name":"卓球","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://jh.kwansei.ac.jp/about/club","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11713,"name":"ラグビー","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://jh.kwansei.ac.jp/about/club","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11714,"name":"ダンス","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://jh.kwansei.ac.jp/about/club","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11715,"name":"美術","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://jh.kwansei.ac.jp/about/club","verified_at":"2026-08-10"},{"id":11716,"name":"図書","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://jh.kwansei.ac.jp/about/club","verifi